---
import MediaPlaceholder from "./MediaPlaceholder.astro";
---

<section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20" id="tokyo">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] bg-terracotta text-cream">
      <div class="grid gap-0 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr]">
        <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16">
          <p class="chip mb-7 w-fit bg-cream/15 text-cream">First city</p>

          <h2 class="display-lg">
            Tokyo, while<br />the blossom lasts.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-7 max-w-lg text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream/80">
            Curio launches in Tokyo in spring 2027, timed to sakura. It's the
            best possible argument for the way this app works: during hanami the
            whole city is worth stopping for, and the good spots are never the
            ones on the list.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-9 space-y-3 text-cream/85">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cream"></span>
              Stories across the city, not just the famous parks
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cream"></span>
              Fully offline — visitor SIMs and metro basements don't always agree
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cream"></span>
              Written by people who live in the neighbourhoods you'll walk through
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mt-9 border-t border-cream/20 pt-6 text-sm text-cream/60">
            Then more cities — and early-access members help pick which.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative min-h-[320px]">
          <MediaPlaceholder
            id="IMG-04"
            label="Tokyo sakura — blossom over a canal or side street, people walking beneath, warm evening light"
            ratio="1/1"
            class="h-full rounded-none"
          />
          <span
            class="chip float-soft absolute bottom-8 left-6 bg-espresso text-cream shadow-lg"
          >
            Spring 2027
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
